  "description": "NPS — NWP Bridge Node: stateless adapters between NPS frames and non-NPS protocols, bidirectional per NPS-CR-0010. Outbound HTTP/HTTPS, gRPC JSON unary, MCP JSON-RPC, and A2A JSON-RPC dispatchers; inbound MCP / A2A / gRPC servers over a pluggable INwpBackend (in-process or HTTP), with ASP.NET Core hosting. Absorbs LabAcacia.McpIngress, LabAcacia.A2aIngress, and LabAcacia.GrpcIngress.",
